fields.doc:
Segment sub-order price range (base). Projected from `ctx.seg_*_price`;
empty for non-segment. Drives the segment TPSL dual-basis change-% anchor
(SegmentTpslValidator R1-R4); non-segment falls back to order_price.

variants.doc:
Submit succeeded across every enabled side. Native dismisses the page.
Dual scenario emits this only when both enabled sides reported success;
single / margin scenarios emit this on any success outcome.
